 Test point | ${x}^{2}$ | ${y}^{3}$ | $f(x,y)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Top-left | $(-1,1)$ | $+$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| Top-Right | $(1,1)$ | $+$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| Bottom-Left | $(-1,-1)$ | $+$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Right | $(1,-1)$ | $+$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n\n \n\nFinally, on our diagram, we shade in the solutions to $f(x,y)\\le 0$ using the *last* column of the table above.\n\n![](images/02/02043b6cfae2cf7987b7df192143b82af474e75b7cfbfa4141a318c9aaed51e5.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256527 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129219 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "490982ac-6197-58eb-8d94-2ef28d659d50" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Quadrants Where a Function Is Positive or Negative"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f4ca1fb-1e0b-53d6-b205-b13a5f751aba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/37/37000a15f2b6164932675c0f0e6dd78fa0ef3015dcc25b27d7dce139e8a1ce4b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186253943} {:answer/id #uuid "59d5fb97-bde7-5ee9-923a-9c291568559a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8f/8fde51124507af53cd4b653856f12976a675dc4bf10a274c84623797ad8e1f2c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254455} {:answer/id #uuid "64b384c1-0cea-5efb-8c4b-1bc3a0ea3c30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/4e/4ea9e14e3150f7566cae93bd241c8c9c1541f0f5c447066760ae26176491fe6a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254573} {:answer/id #uuid "960053fc-39f1-5a4a-9da8-d5e665897e66" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/59/596e25c1d1f8a0e738d8853c17c77c2f6174a2c314a94ce1674f37b3a4c5c72b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254993} {:answer/id #uuid "b6234e2d-0098-5b5f-bb2d-8373b46409f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/03/03b7fe2ba61cbe2608c37a78c82001f6a1fd